5,0,1,talk,Sakura,,Hi everyone! This is so exciting! I wonder who the big bad wolf is? Maybe we should play a game to find out!,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Minato,,A game? I'm not sure if that's a good idea... how are we actually supposed to tell who is lying?,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Takumi,,"We don't need games. We just need to be decisive. If someone acts suspicious, we vote them out immediately. No hesitation.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Mio,,Let's stay calm! I think we should listen to everyone's logic first. We need a plan so we don't accidentally execute a villager.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Shion,,Agreed. The most efficient way is to observe speech patterns. The werewolf and possessed will likely try to manipulate the flow of conversation.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Shion, you sound so serious! Are you trying to act like the smartest person here? That's a bit suspicious, isn't it?","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Minato,,"@Sakura, don't be mean... but @Shion, do you really think you can tell just by how we talk?","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Sakura"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Takumi,,"Stop wasting time with ""feelings."" We should decide on a voting strategy now. I say we target the quietest person first.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Mio,,"@Takumi, that's too reckless! We could lose a valuable ally. We should wait for the Seer to gather some information.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Shion,,"@Sakura's attempt to deflect by questioning my tone is a classic tactic. However, @Takumi's aggression is also a red flag.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Sakura"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Sakura,,"Oh! I was just joking! @Mio is right, let's wait and see what happens. I'll follow whatever the group decides!","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Minato,,I agree with @Mio. It feels safer to wait for a lead than to just guess.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Takumi,,"@Shion, you're just analyzing for the sake of it. If you're so smart, why aren't you giving us a concrete target?","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Mio,,"Let's focus on the facts. Since it's Day 0, we have no evidence. Let's just get to know each other's thinking.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Shion,,"My target is anyone who pushes for a rush without evidence. @Takumi, your impatience is noted.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Sakura,,This is getting intense! I'm just going to watch and learn from you all.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
